-county"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 9 grids runs from 1951 to 2025, and August to September came in under 90% of normal in 38 of those 75 years. In 2025 that pair ran 69% of normal on the middle of the grids, and January to February ran 72%. So far in 2026, January to February came in at 56% of normal on the middle of the grids. Grid 26626 had its driest year in 1964 at 62%.</p>"}
